<title>FRANCE: Moslem rebels kill more than 80 in Algeria - papers.</title>
<headline>Moslem rebels kill more than 80 in Algeria - papers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moslem rebels massacred more than 80 villagers in northeastern Algeria, including all the inhabitants of one hamlet, during the Algerian Moslem weekend of Thursday and Friday, Algerian newspapers said on Sunday.</p>
</text>
